  "date": "2026-10-31",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "央行宣布：11月2日起，隔夜逆回购成为主要政策利率",
  "title_en": "PBOC announces: from November 2, the overnight reverse repo rate becomes the main policy rate",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月30日晚，中国人民银行发布公告：从11月2日起，每个工作日，央行都会做隔夜逆回购操作，利率固定为1.25%。",
      "en": "On the evening of October 30, the People's Bank of China issued an announcement: from November 2, on every working day, the central bank will conduct overnight reverse repo operations at a fixed rate of 1.25%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "逆回购是央行向银行借出短期资金的一种方法。“隔夜”的意思是只借一天。",
      "en": "A reverse repo is a method by which the central bank lends short-term funds to banks. \"Overnight\" means the money is lent for only one day."
    },
    {
      "zh": "七天期逆回购的利率是1.40%，以前它是主要政策利率。现在，隔夜逆回购利率成为主要政策利率。七天期逆回购主要在缴税日和月底使用，采用多重价位招标的方式。",
      "en": "The rate on the seven-day reverse repo is 1.40%, and it used to be the main policy rate. Now the overnight reverse repo rate becomes the main policy rate. The seven-day reverse repo will mainly be used on tax payment dates and at the end of the month, using a multiple-price bidding method."
    },
    {
      "zh": "其他短期借款工具的利率，也会跟着隔夜利率调整，利差不变。10月30日，银行之间隔夜回购的平均利率是1.2890%。",
      "en": "The rates on other short-term lending tools will also be adjusted along with the overnight rate, with the spreads unchanged. On October 30, the average rate on overnight repo between banks was 1.2890%."
    }
  ],
